Hagurumon is raging and has Ikuto's mother imprisoned!

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:44.690
I am Digimon! I not have a human mother!

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:45.470
Ikuto!

00:22:45.470 --> 00:22:47.590
You can never erase your feelings for your parents!

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:50.450
